{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3c1d2f15-3a2b-4db4-9c4c-3d4c0f84c8c2",
    "name": "Tech Challenge API",
    "description": "Collection generated from the project routes and the recorded curl flow in RESULTS.md.\n\nNotes:\n- Admin endpoints require a token with role ADMIN or MANAGER.\n- By default, /auth/register creates a VIEWER.\n  - First ADMIN: promote in DB manually, then login again to refresh the token.\n    Example SQL (inside the Postgres container):\n    UPDATE users SET role='ADMIN' WHERE lower(email)=lower('<email>');\n  - After you have an ADMIN token: promote other users via PUT /admin/users/:id/role (requires ADMIN), then the user should login again.\n\nEnvironment variables expected:\n- baseUrl, access_token, email, password\n- user_id, cpf, client_id, plate, vehicle_id, service_id, part_id, service_order_id, service_order_code\n\nSecurity:\n- This collection uses Bearer auth with {{access_token}} at the collection level. Public routes override auth per-request.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Senha@123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "cpf", "value": "46420082412", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "plate", "value": "ABC1D23", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "client_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "vehicle_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "service_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "part_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "service_order_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "service_order_code", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const email = pm.collectionVariables.get('email');",
          "if (!email) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('email', `teste+gustavo-${Date.now()}@gmail.com`);",
          "}",
          "const baseUrl = pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl');",
          "if (!baseUrl) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('baseUrl', 'http://localhost:8080');",
          "}",
          "const password = pm.collectionVariables.get('password');",
          "if (!password) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('password', 'Senha@123');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
